ference \\citep{Offer-Westort2021DesigningME}, experimental design with network information \\citep{Viviano2020Experimental}, and mixtures of randomized experiments \\citep{Jiang2023Mixture}. We hold the two designs fixed (Bernoulli and block-cluster) and study analysis only.\n197:\\subsection{Reliability: seed variability and interval coverage}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
